  "description": "This is a set of 8 Christmas Digital Paper patterns in shades of red, green and pink.\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality.\nThis set includes patterns with gingerbread cookies, candy canes, peppermint candies, polka dots, snowflakes and stripes.\nThe retro colour palette is perfect for Christmas and the Holiday Season, and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and so much more.\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (36.7 MB) and includes:\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels\n• 8 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n• 8 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For better results, use the JPEG files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm which file type they work with\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings\n– MATCHING CLIPART SET IN MY SHOP! –\nThank you for stopping by! Feel free to check out my entire shop, Creative Wolf Design!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This is a set of 8 Christmas Digital Paper patterns in shades of red, green and pink.<br>\nAll files are seamless, which means you can easily tile them to create larger prints, without losing quality.</p>\n<p>This set includes patterns with gingerbread cookies, candy canes, peppermint candies, polka dots, snowflakes and stripes.</p>\n<p>The retro colour palette is perfect for Christmas and the Holiday Season, and allows you to easily mix and match the patterns for your creative projects. You can use these for scrapbooking and other paper crafts, home decor, small business marketing and packaging materials, wallpaper, wrapping paper and so much more.</p>\n<p>This product comes in 1 Zipped folder (36.7 MB) and includes:<br>\n• High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Paper Patterns<br>\n• High Resolution, at 300 dpi<br>\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm) or 3600 x 3600 pixels</p>\n<p>• 8 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use<br>\n• 8 JPEG files in CMYK – Ideal for printing</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:<br>\n• For better results, use the JPEG files for printing, and the PNG files for digital use<br>\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm which file type they work with<br>\n• Colours may vary due to different screen and printer settings</p>\n<p>– MATCHING CLIPART SET IN MY SHOP! –</p>\n<p>Thank you for stopping by! Feel free to check out my entire shop, Creative Wolf Design!</p>",
